<title>UK: Suedwestlb sets $150 mln five-year bond,  call.</title>
<headline>Suedwestlb sets $150 mln five-year bond,  call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following callable bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT	  $150 MLN  COUPON     7.25	MATURITY   *21.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.725   PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    100.10    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR AFTER TWO YEARS.</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LON/STUT  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
